    description: "On thc, all 2,129 tier-3 symbols have directness=unknown and 2,112 have ecosystem=unknown: per spec §14 directness is computed only from go.mod, Gradle/pom.xml and pyproject.toml; mix.exs/mix.lock and package.json are not read as DependencyManifests, and Elixir has no stdlib catalogue for ecosystem. The run also warns \"DEPENDENCY-LINKER linker found 9740 Import edges from code analyzers but 0 TOML dependency declarations (Cargo.toml, pyproject.toml)\" although mix.exs and package.json exist. With installed-dependency source off by default, boundary stubs are the main view of \"which dependencies does my code call, and how much\" -- this attribution is what makes them useful. Add Mix and npm manifest readers; make the warning name the manifests it actually looked for."  # d921
